When that wise Brahmin was insulting Arjun by saying good and bad things, Arjun
immediately used Yoga Vidya to go to Sanyamani Puri, where Yamaraja resides. Viprapatyamchakshansatah, tat aindrimagatpurim. Agneye nairutheem saumyay vayavyam varunimath. Rasatalam naakaprishtam dhishanyanayanyudayudhah. 3). Tato'labdhadvijasuto hyanisthiratpratishrutah.
